However, the number of entrants fell below 1000, the police assessed that the intervention was not needed, nor did the sanitary station or the Ministry of Health apply for it.
Czech Television (ČT) stated on Sunday that the technoparty had also spread to the surrounding land, whose owners did not agree with the use for the technoparty.
It is possible that the owners of the surrounding land will claim damages.
