The odd feather will stifle doesn’t be very high, in normal contact she is afraid.
And if she has room to do this, she likes to repude away with a loud hypnotity.
It will only attack if they feel very threatened - for example, when you accidentally step on it.
However, its bite is not a tragedy, its venom is very effective against small mammals, but she does not kill people.
This can occur only if a person has a particularly weakened organism or suffers from an allergy.
