We have taken this decision to prevent the possible spread of the virus in the UK," British diplomacy said in a statement.
"We have always made it very clear that in the event that it is necessary, we will immediately remove a certain country from the list of safe ones," she said.
As the British newspaper Metro noted, the most recent announcement will cover the travel plans of thousands of Britons.
